data.reasoningText:
Add a CSS transition for filter to avoid flicker, respecting reduced motion:

```css
.camera-video {
  ...
  transition: filter 300ms ease;
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .camera-video { transition: none; }
}
```
Also, brightness(3.2) will clip highlights; acceptable for framing. Add `contrast(1.05)`? Brightness alone washes out. Use `brightness(x)` only to keep it simple.

Add CSS.

